* P-SSHI RECOMMENDED DEVICE-MODEL SWEEP
* Reduced to devices that are meaningfully different and worth testing
* for a low-voltage piezoelectric P-SSHI switching/rectifier circuit.
*
* Set NPN transistor Value to: {npn}
* Set PNP transistor Value to: {pnp}
* Set swept diode Value to:    {Diode}
*
* Active sweep size: 7 NPN x 7 PNP x 8 diodes = 392 runs.

* -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
* NPN CANDIDATES
* 2N3904: low-current reference
* 2N2222: general-purpose higher-current reference
* BC817-40T116: high-gain 500 mA SMD device
* BSS4130A: high-gain 1 A low-resistance device
* BSS64A: 100 V device for higher P-SSHI voltage
* 2N5550: 150 V device for high-voltage operation
* TIP31C: 3 A power-device reference
* -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
.model 1 ako:2N3904
.model 2 ako:2N2222
.model 3 ako:BC817-40T116
.model 4 ako:BSS4130A
.model 5 ako:BSS64A
.model 6 ako:2N5550
.model 7 ako:TIP31C

* -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
* PNP CANDIDATES
* Selected as corresponding or comparable PNP devices to the NPN set.
* -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
.model 8  ako:2N3906
.model 9  ako:2N2907
.model 10 ako:BC807-40T116
.model 11 ako:BSS5130A
.model 12 ako:BSS63A
.model 13 ako:2N5401
.model 14 ako:TIP32C

* -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
* DIODE CANDIDATES
* BAT54: low-current, low-capacitance Schottky reference
* MBR0520L: 0.5 A low-voltage Schottky
* 1N5817: common 1 A low-voltage Schottky
* PMEG2010EA: modern 1 A low-VF Schottky
* NSR20F30NXT5G: very-low-voltage Schottky candidate
* MBR0540: 40 V Schottky for more voltage margin
* BAT46WJ: 100 V, relatively low-capacitance Schottky
* MURS120: fast silicon diode control/reference
* -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
.model 15 ako:BAT54
.model 16 ako:MBR0520L
.model 17 ako:1N5817
.model 18 ako:PMEG2010EA
.model 19 ako:NSR20F30NXT5G
.model 20 ako:MBR0540
.model 21 ako:BAT46WJ
.model 22 ako:MURS120

* -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
* ACTIVE SWEEPS
* -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
.step param npn list 1 2 3 4 5 6 7
.step param pnp list 8 9 10 11 12 13 14
.step param Diode list 15 16 17 18 19 20 21 22
